    6 => [
        [1, 'Take heed that ye do not your alms before men, to be seen of them: otherwise ye have no reward of your Father which is in heaven.', ['p' => 1, 'w' => [0, 129]]],
        [2, 'Therefore when thou doest thine alms, do not sound a trumpet before thee, as the hypocrites do in the synagogues and in the streets, that they may have glory of men. Verily I say unto you, They have their reward.', ['w' => [0, 212], 'i' => [26, 31]]],
        [3, 'But when thou doest alms, let not thy left hand know what thy right hand doeth:', ['w' => [0, 79]]],
        [4, 'That thine alms may be in secret: and thy Father which seeth in secret himself shall reward thee openly.', ['w' => [0, 104]]],
        [5, 'And when thou prayest, thou shalt not be as the hypocrites are: for they love to pray standing in the synagogues and in the corners of the streets, that they may be seen of men. Verily I say unto you, They have their reward.', ['p' => 1, 'w' => [0, 224], 'i' => [59, 63]]],
        [6, 'But thou, when thou prayest, enter into thy closet, and when thou hast shut thy door, pray to thy Father which is in secret; and thy Father which seeth in secret shall reward thee openly.', ['w' => [0, 187]]],
        [7, 'But when ye pray, use not vain repetitions, as the heathen do: for they think that they shall be heard for their much speaking.', ['w' => [0, 127], 'i' => [59, 62]]],
        [8, 'Be not ye therefore like unto them: for your Father knoweth what things ye have need of, before ye ask him.', ['w' => [0, 107]]],
        [9, 'After this manner therefore pray ye: Our Father which art in heaven, Hallowed be thy name.', ['w' => [0, 90]]],
        [10, 'Thy kingdom come. Thy will be done in earth, as it is in heaven.', ['w' => [0, 64], 'i' => [48, 53]]],
        [11, 'Give us this day our daily bread.', ['w' => [0, 33]]],
        [12, 'And forgive us our debts, as we forgive our debtors.', ['w' => [0, 52]]],
        [13, 'And lead us not into temptation, but deliver us from evil: For thine is the kingdom, and the power, and the glory, for ever. Amen.', ['w' => [0, 130]]],
        [14, 'For if ye forgive men their trespasses, your heavenly Father will also forgive you:', ['w' => [0, 83]]],
        [15, 'But if ye forgive not men their trespasses, neither will your Father forgive your trespasses.', ['w' => [0, 93]]],
